{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>And she called his name Zevulun.</b> Corresponding to the central line above, which is aligned opposite the central line below. Therefore the Temple below is called זבול, and he is the sixth son, corresponding to the ו in the Name; and this is the sense of ״כי ילדתי לו ששה בנים״ — 'for I have borne him six sons' — ״ותקרא את שמו זבולן״."], :book :genesis, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 30, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:16:29.009887358Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}